        "content": "<h1><strong>About Us: Puzzle Zen - Piece Together Your Perfect Energy</strong></h1><p>At Puzzle Zen, we recognize that every home tells a story and holds the power to transform the lives within it. Our why is simple yet profound: to help you create a nurturing environment that channels peace and prosperity. We believe achieving harmony at home is a personal journey. Our mission is to offer a diverse selection of Feng Shui elements, enabling you to create an arrangement that aligns with your individual energy.</p><h1><strong>Our Story: The First Piece of the Puzzle</strong></h1><p>The first piece of our puzzle was laid by our founder, Mollie Yang. With a degree in Landscape Architecture from San Francisco and 7 years in the building industry, she observed a powerful truth: the design and energy of a home directly shape the lives of those within it. It was during a visit to a friend’s cramped apartment in the city, where the afternoon light barely pierced through the cluttered decor, that an idea took root. In envisioning the space transformed into a serene haven, Mollie felt the undeniable energy shift that could result—an insight that set the foundation for Puzzle Zen.</p><p>This insight sparked a quest to move beyond traditional design and explore the ancient art of Feng Shui. Mollie wondered: if everyone's energy is different,why are Feng Shui solutions so often one-size-fits-all? This question became the cornerstone of Puzzle Zen.</p>",
